      "repo": "arxiv",
      "path": "abs/2510.01832",
      "line_start": 1,
      "line_end": 1,
      "excerpt": "we introduce SCRIBES (SCRIpt-Based Semi-Structured Content Extraction at Web-Scale), a novel reinforcement learning framework that leverages layout similarity across webpages within the same site as a reward signal... outperforms strong baselines by over 13% in script quality and boosts downstream question answering accuracy by more than 4% for GPT-4o"
    },
    {
      "repo": "arxiv",
      "path": "html/2510.01832 §3.3.2 / §Introduction",
      "line_start": 1,
      "line_end": 1,
      "excerpt": "We then apply language filters to select English content websites and group webpages by domain... SCRIBES draws training data from two sources. First, it learns from a small set of annotated examples (192 pages from 34 groups)"
    }
  ],
